WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.324 --> 00:00:12.608
It was the day of the baptism.

2
00:00:13.708 --> 00:00:16.430
The king and queen waited for the guests to arrive.

3
00:00:17.470 --> 00:00:19.771
A nanny stood nearby, holding the baby.

4
00:00:25.713 --> 00:00:28.034
a wonderful day," the king said.

5
00:00:28.054 --> 00:00:33.852
"Our friends and family are coming to—Oh no!"

6
00:00:33.872 --> 00:00:34.893
He slapped his forehead.

7
00:00:34.913 --> 00:00:37.035
"There's Lady Agnes.

8
00:00:40.177 --> 00:00:42.119
I forgot to send her an invitation!"

9
00:00:45.582 --> 00:00:46.142
He waved.

10
00:00:46.162 --> 00:00:48.624
"Welcome, Sister."

11
00:00:50.065 --> 00:00:51.046
Agnes frowned.

12
00:00:51.066 --> 00:00:57.732
"You forgot to invite me, but I came anyway."

13
00:00:58.852 --> 00:01:00.274
Her eyes flashed blue.

14
00:01:00.294 --> 00:01:05.766
"I would never miss this special day."

15
00:01:08.708 --> 00:01:10.610
The king turned to greet more guests.

16
00:01:13.152 --> 00:01:14.893
Agnes looked around for the font.

17
00:01:17.175 --> 00:01:19.937
That was where a priest would bless the baby with water.

18
00:01:20.998 --> 00:01:23.200
Agnes walked over and stood next to it.

19
00:01:24.761 --> 00:01:27.083
Soon everyone gathered around the font.

20
00:01:28.144 --> 00:01:30.806
The priest was about to dip a cup into the water.

21
00:01:33.068 --> 00:01:34.148
"Now!" Agnes thought.

22
00:01:35.289 --> 00:01:37.570
She tossed a potion into the water.

23
00:01:38.390 --> 00:01:42.692
Then she spun around three times and whispered a spell.

24
00:01:44.313 --> 00:01:47.014
Light of spirit, by my charms.

25
00:01:47.834 --> 00:01:50.115
Light of body, every part.

26
00:01:51.075 --> 00:01:53.136
Never hurt human arms.

27
00:01:53.796 --> 00:01:56.177
Just crush your parents' heart!

28
00:02:00.439 --> 00:02:04.124
The baby suddenly laughed, and Nanny let out a gasp.

29
00:02:05.765 --> 00:02:10.146
She didn't tell anyone that now Ellen felt lighter than air!

30
00:02:12.067 --> 00:02:14.508
At first no one realized something was wrong.

31
00:02:15.488 --> 00:02:18.969
But soon after the baptism, there was an odd event.

32
00:02:21.810 --> 00:02:24.531
Ellen flew out of Nanny's arms!

33
00:02:25.351 --> 00:02:29.032
The tiny baby kicked and laughed as she floated around the room.

34
00:02:31.436 --> 00:02:32.417
"Help!" Nanny cried.

35
00:02:33.537 --> 00:02:36.539
A servant rushed in, and Nanny pointed to the ceiling.

36
00:02:36.559 --> 00:02:40.281
"The baby is floating!"

37
00:02:40.681 --> 00:02:41.161
she said.

38
00:02:43.323 --> 00:02:44.903
The servant ran for a ladder.

39
00:02:46.344 --> 00:02:48.225
Nanny climbed up to fetch the baby.

40
00:02:51.807 --> 00:02:53.228
Later it happened again.

41
00:02:53.848 --> 00:02:55.870
This time the king was holding the baby.

42
00:02:55.890 --> 00:02:58.471
"How odd, my queen."

43
00:02:59.431 --> 00:03:00.052
He frowned.

44
00:03:00.796 --> 00:03:02.517
"I can't feel Ellen in my arms.

45
00:03:03.057 --> 00:03:03.997
It's as if—" Shwoop!

46
00:03:04.317 --> 00:03:06.598
The baby floated out of his arms.

47
00:03:08.958 --> 00:03:10.919
She laughed and danced in the air.

48
00:03:17.861 --> 00:03:18.681
the king cried.

49
00:03:19.401 --> 00:03:21.362
The servant came running with the ladder.

50
00:03:22.082 --> 00:03:25.103
He climbed up and grabbed the baby with a pair of tongs.

51
00:03:26.243 --> 00:03:28.023
The king and queen turned to each other.

52
00:03:28.764 --> 00:03:29.584
The king gulped.

53
00:03:30.764 --> 00:03:32.566
"The princess is too light!"

54
00:03:32.586 --> 00:03:35.569
"Yes," the queen said in horror.

55
00:03:35.589 --> 00:03:37.951
"Her gravity is gone!"
